topic: "跨库 tracked 基线变更的运输安全证据协议（cute_tiled 1.0.0）"
error_signature: "current-library atomicity evidence reports pre-existing cross-library tracked changes as a bare count without exact paths or before/after working-tree content plus git diff --binary hashes, losing identity and invariance in transport"
affected_paths:
  - "archives/l/libXext/README.md"
  - "archives/l/libXext/manifest.yaml"
root_cause: "out-of-scope tracked cross-library working-tree changes pre-existed cute_tiled worktree creation; when audit evidence omits identity (exact paths) and invariance (before/after content + binary-diff hashes), such changes can be mistaken for current-library pollution, causing wrong PR-scope judgement or unrelated cleanup demand"
durable_solution:
  - "enumerate the exact baseline paths and declare them outside the current-library file whitelist"
  - "before and after any delivery, record per-path working-tree SHA-256 and SHA-256 of 'git diff --binary -- <path>' output and require exact equality"
  - "separately prove archives/c/cute_tiled/** has no staged/unstaged changes and the git index is empty (git diff --cached --name-only count 0)"
  - "never clean, restore, or stage the cross-library baseline files"
impact: "count-only evidence without identity/invariance leaves the cross-library baseline unreviewable after transport and turns it into an untraceable 'current-library anomaly' assertion; the correct protocol lets any later audit verify zero baseline mutation and re-check scope judgement"
recovery_condition: "a generic client/preflight that rejects any unstaged change regardless of current-library scope is a shared-client limitation; repair it without modifying the cross-library baseline files. Remote Path B delivery (commit/push/PR/Issue) is deferred to a later authorized task using the analysis-prepared authoritative Issue template and official PR template"
evidence_references:
  - "commit 4d4ea63bb75f8d161eed37ba72cf3d68bdbeb687 (branch feat/cute_tiled-1.0.0, exact 15-file whitelist)"
  - "libXext baseline prestate/poststate hashes (working-tree + git diff --binary, before == after)"
  - "cute_tiled delivery atomicity audit records (index empty, archives/c/cute_tiled/** unchanged)"
status: draft_pending_review